  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Ah, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. I hear you’ve\nbeen<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhard<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nat<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwork<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLumiose,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nas<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nalways.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since you’re here, would you care to take a look at\nthis?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530069006E0063006500200079006F007520190072006500200068006500720065002C00200077006F0075006C006400200079006F00750020006300610072006500200074006F002000740061006B0065002000610020006C006F006F006B002000610074000A0074006800690073003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What is it?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000690073002000690074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A...Poké Ball?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002E002E002E0050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is a Pokémon that was made by human hands\nsome 500 years ago. It is called Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We recovered it during our redevelopment work,\nbut it appears to be in a dormant state.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If we want to awaken it, we must find a way to\npower its internal mechanisms.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To do so would require a Mega Stone specific to\nMagearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00200064006F00200073006F00200077006F0075006C006400200072006500710075006900720065002000610020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E006500200073007000650063006900660069006300200074006F000A004D00610067006500610072006E0061002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We had asked AZ to create one for us, but since\nthat will unfortunately no longer be possible...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe will have our team here at Quasartico Inc.\nproduce the stone.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Can we ask you to assist us with gathering the\nnecessary materials, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe will require <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Mega Shards<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> to create this\nparticular Mega Stone.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 159
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magearna is in a dormant state.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610067006500610072006E006100200069007300200069006E0020006100200064006F0072006D0061006E0074002000730074006100740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>We require <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999 Mega Shards<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe truly appreciate your help.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 17,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>How good of you to come,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nDo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhave<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnecessary<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMega Shards?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Got ’em right here",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047006F0074002020190065006D002000720069006700680074002000680065007200650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not quite yet...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007100750069007400650020007900650074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh? Then what could you have wanted, I wonder?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068003F0020005400680065006E0020007700680061007400200063006F0075006C006400200079006F007500200068006100760065002000770061006E007400650064002C0020004900200077006F006E006400650072003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You handed over 999 Mega Shards!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000680061006E0064006500640020006F00760065007200200039003900390020004D006500670061002000530068006100720064007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for gathering these.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200066006F007200200067006100740068006500720069006E0067002000740068006500730065002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ll have the team get started at once to\nproduce a Mega Stone for Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magearna’s Mega Stone is ready. Here it is—\nMagearnite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610067006500610072006E0061201900730020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E0065002000690073002000720065006100640079002E002000480065007200650020006900740020006900732014000A004D00610067006500610072006E006900740065002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please see if you can send energy to Magearna\nusing your Mega Ring’s Key Stone.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "*fwoom*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002A00660077006F006F006D002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah! Good morning to you, Magearna. How lovely\nto see you awake.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002100200047006F006F00640020006D006F0072006E0069006E006700200074006F00200079006F0075002C0020004D00610067006500610072006E0061002E00200048006F00770020006C006F00760065006C0079000A0074006F002000730065006500200079006F00750020006100770061006B0065002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truly wonderful...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400720075006C007900200077006F006E00640065007200660075006C002E002E002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. I hope we can rely on\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nshow<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMagearna<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwide<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nworld,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nafter<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsuch<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlong<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntime asleep.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 31,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received Magearna!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020004D00610067006500610072006E006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh dear. Are your Boxes all full?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006800200064006500610072002E002000410072006500200079006F0075007200200042006F00780065007300200061006C006C002000660075006C006C003F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please take good care of Magearna.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000740061006B006500200067006F006F0064002000630061007200650020006F00660020004D00610067006500610072006E0061002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And take this Mega Stone as well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000740061006B0065002000740068006900730020004D006500670061002000530074006F006E0065002000610073002000770065006C006C002E001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I so appreciate all you do to look after this fine\ncity—and <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> as well.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
